Workflow Run ID:
26885065773

---

# Step 12 - Upload Report

GitHub Actions uploads:

delivery-report.txt

as an artifact.

Location:

Actions
→ Workflow Run
→ Artifacts
→ Download

Reports remain available for audit and traceability.

---

# Security Model

Client owns:

Repository
Token

Our repository owns:

Workflow
Automation

The token grants access only to the repositories selected by the client.

No source code is exposed unless explicitly copied.

---

# Production Flow

Developer
↓
Feature
↓
Develop
↓
Stage
↓
Main
↓
GitHub Actions
↓
Build Generated
↓
Client Repository
↓
Delivery Report Generated
↓
Artifact Stored

---

# Memory Shortcut

Token is CREATED by the client.

Token is STORED in our repository secret.

Token is USED by GitHub Actions.

Token gives ACCESS to the client repository.

GitHub Actions PUSHES files to the client repository.

Delivery Report proves what was delivered.
